# OS and Editor artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.bak
*.tmp
*.log
*.orig
.vscode/
.idea/

# Strict No-Binary & No-Executable rule (AGENTS.md)
/target/
**/*.exe
**/*.pdb
**/*.ilk
**/*.exp
**/*.lib

# Strict No-Image rule (AGENTS.md: 所有點陣圖片與圖示絕不上傳版本庫)
/images/
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.ico
**/*.bmp
**/*.webp

# Temporary & backup folders
scratch/
_backups/
_logs_and_temp/
